	"system": {
		"description": {
			"value": "<p><strong>Permanent</strong> - 10 ft. Emanation (Self) - Magical</p><ul><li><p>Allies in the aura are immune to &amp;reference[blinded apply=false] and &amp;reference[deafened apply=false] conditions. Zones that silence sound also do not function in this aura.</p></li><li><p>If a creature who is already blinded or deafened comes within 10 ft. of you, this does not end the condition, but does grant the creature &amp;reference[advantage] on saves to end the condition.</p></li><li><p>This ability does not function when you are &amp;reference[Petrified apply=false] or &amp;reference[Unconscious apply=false].</p></li></ul><p>At 18th level, the range of this aura increases to 30 feet.</p><p><em>A physical barrier, including an object or effect covering the eyes, can still impose blindness, at the GM's discretion.</em></p>",
